{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Probe built and pushed (Gerrit 1359). Two process constraints hit, both recorded.\n\n`scripts/jira_dc_epic_link_clear_probe.py` + `.github/workflows/jira-dc-epic-link-probe.yml`: plain deterministic urllib, four predetermined REST calls, **no LLM and no agent**, so it cannot re-run or churn the committed capability map. Three parity guards assert that separation in `test_jira_dc_capability_map_workflow.py` — dispatch-only, read-only permissions, and explicitly that the workflow neither invokes `jira_dc_capability_map.py` nor carries an `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`. It runs in CI because the harness image is linux/amd64-only.\n\n### Constraint 1 — it cannot be dispatched until it LANDS\n\n`gh workflow run --ref probe/epic-link-clear` fails:\n\n    HTTP 404: workflow jira-dc-epic-link-probe.yml not found on the default branch\n\nGitHub only dispatches `workflow_dispatch` files that exist on the DEFAULT branch, so unlike a harness run (which reuses an already-landed workflow on a topic branch) this probe must merge to `main` first. That is a real sequencing cost for any NEW workflow and worth knowing before designing the next one.\n\n### Constraint 2 — my own process miss\n\n1359 drew `LLM-Review -1`, sole finding `bugfix-size-attestation`: 289 non-test lines with no plan-review attestation on this bug. AGENTS.md prescribes exactly this for a fix whose blast radius reaches non-test code — declare `file_impact`, write the plan into the description, run `review-plan` BEFORE implementing — and I went straight to writing the probe. Corrected: `file_impact` now declares all three paths with reasons, and `review-plan` returned **PASS with zero blocking**. Recheck posted.\n\nThe finding was correct and the gate did its job; the sequence was mine to get right."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785859650064944001,"uuid":"21cfb8d4-1eaf-4efb-94ce-8d9f03e01d5f"}